[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151241807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3151241807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3151241807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc671CJP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T15:27:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T15:42:05Z","body":"Scons 4.0 is required to build, see [compiling for Linux/BSD](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.html), and Godot does not support that old Linux versions according to the [system requirements page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/about/system_requirements.html#id1)\n\nSo this falls very far outside the supported range of versions, even though Ubuntu 16.04 is LTS it needs to support the things Godot supports\n\nThe issue here is arguably the documentation note that needs to be updated\n\nOfficial templates are built with the [build-root](https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot) portable library builds (and are built on Fedora 42 currently)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151241807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151334806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3151334806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3151334806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc671Y2W","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T15:57:06Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T15:57:06Z","body":"Created a PR to update the suggested version as of 4.5:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11173","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151334806/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152380993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3152380993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3152380993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc675YRB","user":{"login":"domdfcoding","id":8050853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA4NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8050853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/domdfcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T20:53:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T20:53:51Z","body":"I don't know if the [deadsnakes PPA](https://launchpad.net/~deadsnakes/+archive/ubuntu/ppa) still works on 16.04 (I only see 20.04 and later listed, but older Pythons might still be there for older Ubuntus, try it) but the alternative is building Python from source. It's not that complex and doesn't take particularly long. [This](https://gist.github.com/domdfcoding/8c541432c361ff70e3ee2ca65d0607ae) is the script I use - see dependencies and symlink note at the top. You might have to adjust the library versions slightly.\n\nThat gets you a new enough Python to run scons but whether godot can still compile and run remains to be seen.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152380993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152404042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3152404042","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3152404042,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc675d5K","user":{"login":"jedomed","id":58390057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzkwMDU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58390057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed","html_url":"https://github.com/jedomed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T21:04:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T21:04:53Z","body":"> I don't know if the [deadsnakes PPA](https://launchpad.net/~deadsnakes/+archive/ubuntu/ppa) still works on 16.04 (I only see 20.04 and later listed, but older Pythons might still be there for older Ubuntus, try it) but the alternative is building Python from source. It's not that complex and doesn't take particularly long. [This](https://gist.github.com/domdfcoding/8c541432c361ff70e3ee2ca65d0607ae) is the script I use - see dependencies and symlink note at the top. You might have to adjust the library versions slightly.\n> \n> That gets you a new enough Python to run scons but whether godot can still compile and run remains to be seen.\n\nI'm not insistent on 16.04, I just wanted to compile with at least the same level of compatibility as the official template. I assumed from the docs that 16.04 was the way to do it, but that's clearly not the case 😃 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152404042/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152425346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3152425346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3152425346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc675jGC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T21:14:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T21:14:05Z","body":"The best way to have the same level of compatibility is to use official build scripts and containers, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts\n\nIt's using Fedora 42, and a custom tool chain targeting glibc 2.28, which is higher than 16.04 but lower than 18.04.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152425346/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3153839074","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109303#issuecomment-3153839074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109303","id":3153839074,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67-8Pi","user":{"login":"jedomed","id":58390057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzkwMDU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58390057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed","html_url":"https://github.com/jedomed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jedomed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T07:30:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T07:33:37Z","body":"> The best way to have the same level of compatibility is to use official build scripts and containers, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts\n\nThanks! I completely missed that repo 😃 maybe it could be mentioned it in the docs too?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3153839074/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]